id=vollaflashdual
name=Volla Quintus Dual-Flash + Torch Strength
version=v4.0
versionCode=5
author=blue-boy-questions
description=Native dual-LED flash (8-byte HAL patch) + torch brightness slider by restoring the DariaOS strength implementation into the AIDL camera-device layer (the current ROM ships it stubbed to ENOSYS). Magic-mount overlay, no Xposed, auto-recovery. Volla Quintus / zahedan (algiz, mt6877) only.
